{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_33","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/bash -lc 'cp \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/judge-target.json\" \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/judge-target.json\" 2>/dev/null || true\ncp \"$(dirname \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT\")/judge-target.json\" \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/judge-target.json\" 2>/dev/null || true\ncat >\"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/logs/finalize-index.py\" <<'\"'PY'\nimport os, pathlib, json, hashlib\nout=pathlib.Path(os.environ['STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT']); target=pathlib.Path(os.environ['STAMPED_JUDGE_TARGET'])\nrows=[]\nfor base,dirs,files in os.walk(target,followlinks=False):\n    dirs[:]=[d for d in dirs if d not in ('.git','.entire','atlas_cache')]\n    for name in files:\n        p=pathlib.Path(base)/name\n        rows.append(p.relative_to(target).as_posix())\n(out/'workspace-visible-files.txt').write_text('\\\\n'.join(sorted(rows))+'\\\\n')\nif not (out/'judge-target.json').exists():\n    p=pathlib.Path(os.environ['STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT']).parent/'judge-target.json'\n    if p.exists(): (out/'judge-target.json').write_bytes(p.read_bytes())\n# Exact commands and where retained output/failure records live.\ntext='''# Command and output retention index\n\nAll assessment products and command logs are outside the operational target. Read-only Git commands were directed to \"'`$STAMPED_JUDGE_TARGET`. The original `assessment.py check` ran before probe/response actions; a repeated check was retained in `logs/00-check.*`. `GIT_OPTIONAL_LOCKS=0`, `annex.merge-annex-branches=false`, and `annex.alwayscommit=false` remained inherited.\n\n| Action | Command / output record |\n|---|---|\n| Frozen runner check | `logs/00-check.command.txt`, `logs/00-check.stdout.txt`, `logs/00-check.stderr.txt` |\n| Probe run | `logs/probes.command.txt`, `logs/probes.stdout.txt`, `logs/probes.stderr.txt`; final copy `2026-10-16-probes.json` |\n| Frozen help and usage discovery | `logs/help-*.stdout.txt`, `logs/help-*.stderr.txt`; response help captured in earlier tool transcript and template output in `logs/response-template.*` |\n| Checklist pin | `logs/pin-check.stdout.txt`, `logs/pin-check.stderr.txt` |\n| Git state / route | `logs/git-status.*`, `git-head.*`, `git-remotes.*`, `git-last-commit.*`, `git-config.*` |\n| Scientific artifact inspection | `logs/worker-report.*`, `worker-analysis.*`, `task-and-upstream.*`, `scientific-results.*`; `workspace-visible-files.txt` |\n| Source route HEAD checks | `logs/access-neurovault.command.txt`, `.stdout.txt`, `.stderr.txt`; corresponding `access-github.*` |\n| Complete-copy integrity comparison | `logs/integrity-audit.*`, `integrity-audit.json` |\n| Response construction and table | `logs/build-records.*`, `logs/response-stamp.*`, `logs/response-table.*`, `2026-10-16-item-table.md` |\n| Failed intermediate report-build attempts | `logs/write-report-failed.*`, `logs/write-report-failed2.*`; corrected build in `logs/write-report.*` |\n| Initial response validation failure | `logs/response-validate-initial.*`; final successful validation in `logs/response-validate.*` |\n| Checklist URL encoding | `logs/response-encode.command.txt`, `logs/response-encode.stderr.txt`, `2026-10-16-url.txt` |\n| Scientific record validation | `logs/scientific-validate.*` |\n\nThe first broad manifest/file listing was truncated in the tool display; its relevant capture identity and entry counts are retained in `integrity-audit.json`, the capture manifest remains at the canonical manifest URI, and the compact workspace listing is `workspace-visible-files.txt`. No replay was attempted; the full decision and planned outputs are in `replay-record.json`.\n'\"'''\n(out/'command-history.md').write_text(text)\nprint(json.dumps({'visible_paths':len(rows),'judge_target_copy':(out/'judge-target.json').exists(),'history':str(out/'command-history.md')},indent=2))\nPY\npython3 \\\"\"'$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/logs/finalize-index.py\" >\"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/logs/finalize-index.stdout.txt\" 2>\"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/logs/finalize-index.stderr.txt\"\nprintf '\"'%s\\\\n' 'python3 \"'$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/logs/finalize-index.py'\"' >\\\"\"'$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/logs/finalize-index.command.txt\"\ncat \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/logs/finalize-index.stdout.txt\"; cat \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/logs/finalize-index.stderr.txt\"\nprintf '\"'\\\\n--- JUDGE TARGET RETAINED ---\\\\n'; ls -l \\\"\"'$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/judge-target.json\" 2>/dev/null || true\n'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
